### A partial unique index: `(customer_id, po_number)` unique `where: status != 'cancelled'`. A customer's
### purchase order pays for one open job; cancelling the job releases the PO. Three 201s are the controls
### that make the 409 the `where` and the `(customer, po)` key, not a plain unique on `po_number`.

### Acme's job on PO-778
# @name PoFirst
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [201]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/api/work_orders
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenant_id": "{{tenantNorth}}", "reference": "WO-3301", "title": "Integrity: WO-3301", "status": "new", "priority": 3, "access_code": "ACME-3301", "customer_id": "{{CustomerAcmeId}}", "region_id": "{{RegionNorthId}}", "po_number": "PO-778" }

### A second open Acme job on the same PO
# @name PoAgain
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [409]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/api/work_orders
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenant_id": "{{tenantNorth}}", "reference": "WO-3302", "title": "Integrity: WO-3302", "status": "new", "priority": 3, "access_code": "ACME-3302", "customer_id": "{{CustomerAcmeId}}", "region_id": "{{RegionNorthId}}", "po_number": "PO-778" }

### Another customer may carry the same PO number: the key is the pair (control)
# @name PoOtherCustomer
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [201]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/api/work_orders
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenant_id": "{{tenantNorth}}", "reference": "WO-3303", "title": "Integrity: WO-3303", "status": "new", "priority": 3, "access_code": "ACME-3303", "customer_id": "{{CustomerBorovicaId}}", "region_id": "{{RegionNorthId}}", "po_number": "PO-778" }

### Cancel the first job (`cancel` admits `new`)
# @name CancelFirst
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [200]
PATCH {{fsBaseUrl}}/api/work_orders/{{PoFirst.response.body.$.id}}
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "cancelled" }

### The PO is free again: the cancelled row is outside the index (control)
# @name PoAfterCancel
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [201]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/api/work_orders
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenant_id": "{{tenantNorth}}", "reference": "WO-3304", "title": "Integrity: WO-3304", "status": "new", "priority": 3, "access_code": "ACME-3304", "customer_id": "{{CustomerAcmeId}}", "region_id": "{{RegionNorthId}}", "po_number": "PO-778" }
